              <lg xml:id="m-da89fa91-056f-4802-8ffa-65cd863082c0">
                <l xml:id="m-c70a1c53-877a-440f-9fe1-4bc57048eedf" facs="#m-6ee22838-9095-4d9b-9189-619d117bac6d" label="ambiguous">483</l><l xml:id="m-ba1611f8-cadb-4bee-870b-406a919f99d6" facs="#m-3d30c6c0-3e4b-4993-abcd-44b2dd016930" label="text-like">octave of the Epiphany.</l><l xml:id="m-b9d0838e-be12-4689-a633-aa637d8704b5" facs="#m-978f2471-fa78-4582-8c15-812febde5744" label="ambiguous">Sixth Day.</l><l xml:id="m-6849aefc-ccb4-4a39-b110-c82e6c05968a" facs="#m-d80d771c-68d9-4d93-bbe5-39379e93543c" label="ambiguous">11.</l><l xml:id="m-38edfa9d-a01a-4318-bb73-9f880274fa98" facs="#m-15d4ed2c-4dac-4f64-aeb4-22627784398c" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-ea34051b-afdb-47c5-8311-c7f01646e8ba" facs="#m-e88ad722-5374-46ee-aa4a-1f8726640884" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.f</l><l xml:id="m-48a491ae-b323-42ae-a9f1-b6099b108bf9" facs="#m-80e82f7c-c0b4-4165-99d4-8748be1cbf41" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-c120d46b-f2b1-4e97-bec7-7791108eac74" facs="#m-cbe463e7-4148-4c01-aacc-2b4c548cddba" label="lyrics-like">Dmó-ni-ti Mági"in sómnis ab Ange-lo,</l><l xml:id="m-b4836e09-b8c3-4be8-85a2-b923963ec1a5" facs="#m-78fceee0-b3cd-4e38-9487-e2d4327bf39a" label="ambiguous">per</l><l xml:id="m-6ee667e0-5058-4aa2-8805-22fd1fd236a0" facs="#m-b4de4088-8d2a-41cc-8ea4-77e9393aba73" label="lyrics-like">á-li-am vi- am revérsi sunt in regi-ónem sú¬am.</l><l xml:id="m-7c3a87f1-fb60-4e90-bbdd-a4606093a807" facs="#m-001cbaee-f223-49cb-8929-83da9d19c904" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-4bd4ee9c-ce5d-4a0e-b87f-09bc19187dc4" facs="#m-1b6efdf4-7dee-4910-847b-854a0c4a6e81" label="text-like">Comm. of S. Hyginus, Pope and Martyr. Ant. Iste sanctus. p. 262.</l><l xml:id="m-108585ac-f2b5-4953-ac35-c4b3284949e1" facs="#m-d925763a-d27d-46bc-9e41-7091e6ae6331" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-5db6a841-4075-4a20-9571-fb51429284c7" facs="#m-52d9d36f-6956-4045-b96a-d06fdb642550" label="lyrics-like">Regem tuum, Pastor aetérne, tua protectióne custódi; * quem</l><l xml:id="m-8320347f-bf5e-44af-9cf9-fc1c91e94388" facs="#m-d4b269ff-a182-4315-8f6d-a1b0d3c102e8" label="lyrics-like">O placátus inténde: t et per</l><l xml:id="m-3092ce5a-19a0-4cec-923b-09a97d27e7e2" facs="#m-e8d173a3-53b5-4d44-bd51-9e5c35ea659e" label="lyrics-like">totius Ecclésiae praestitisti esse</l><l xml:id="m-b549ec57-0616-422f-95e4-e59dfd7bf0cf" facs="#m-02c5888d-adaa-4abe-867f-6937436f06b8" label="lyrics-like">beátum Hygínum Mártyrem tuum</l><l xml:id="m-a04791ea-4e37-4b3e-b579-4c8db71761ef" facs="#m-363bd2bf-5cca-44bb-a92c-ee28d0739775" label="lyrics-like">pastórem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2208704d-edbe-4de5-8d90-96aeabea3e2c" facs="#m-c2d00037-2e1f-4b22-aecb-45bddf520254" label="lyrics-like">atque Summum Pontificem, perpé¬</l><l xml:id="m-62fa7fad-a37f-42ff-9e34-59cd869cc32b" facs="#m-6a23e2c1-2c9b-42d1-a6a3-32075c37a618" label="text-like">Tif the Octave of the Epiphany falls on a Sunday, the Office is said of the</l><l xml:id="m-b04d5d99-2065-4d61-bb82-f8f080a0a3d8" facs="#m-013d7468-34d2-4823-a5af-c566bab52621" label="text-like">Octave, and the Feast of the Holy Family is celebrated on the preceding</l><l xml:id="m-1a13c563-c5e6-4571-aa19-61a59e4fb98f" facs="#m-94be3736-5043-461b-8fad-616b9bf5fcd9" label="ambiguous">Saturday.</l><l xml:id="m-85a05f75-2b65-45c8-add9-c05bf7449fbf" facs="#m-b8cacf96-7fa4-4979-aa13-3eeb00fae0c9" label="text-like">Octave of the Epiphany.</l><l xml:id="m-3bba2cdb-06d1-44c2-a1ef-d87c9023091c" facs="#m-e1b4740a-0e30-44d2-b922-cda13c5a4a63" label="ambiguous">Double major.</l><l xml:id="m-8378da59-0503-46a2-89d6-3c4d9b0994c7" facs="#m-1a90abd0-89ff-4dfe-812c-2405702b98c4" label="text-like">All as on the Feast itself, p. 455, except the following.</l><l xml:id="m-d416cb89-c6e2-4fa4-9553-5bc86b7a97e2" facs="#m-c0558eb5-28ac-47bc-9254-2596be1fbb94" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-e58fe680-7cea-4737-9907-da6dd4a5d8c6" facs="#m-39f5b0a4-9a18-4b02-9bc8-80aa6283cd63" label="lyrics-like">Eus, cujus Unigénitus in sub-! eum, quem símilem nobis foris</l><l xml:id="m-bf4fd9d4-79c2-430a-ae35-6e97906a12c4" facs="#m-a075a328-0fbf-4e8b-bee7-7b5b2e40d8ff" label="lyrics-like">Istántia nostrae carnis appá- agnóvimus, * intus reformári me¬</l><l xml:id="m-e8c8e673-bbf5-4c50-8ac7-1a13b044b888" facs="#m-44730f86-000a-42c6-af03-e29d815f730e" label="lyrics-like">ruit:t praesta, quaésumus; ut per ] reámur. Qui tecum vivit.</l><l xml:id="m-5e6b1921-edb7-4c75-9421-c1b6664f2f69" facs="#m-5c70bd5c-e795-46a5-b8d1-2fa42136a9d9" label="ambiguous">1 Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. T. d.</l><l xml:id="m-81c7749f-19ed-4ba6-bda0-af4a1321a856" facs="#m-ba8e3d95-b89c-43cd-9dbf-43343a6d50d4" label="lyrics-like">IN illo témpore: Vidit Joánnes (Spíritum descendéntem quasi co</l><l xml:id="m-2f9fb99a-f3f0-42ae-8183-d5c0600ac695" facs="#m-d6d03848-0092-46c6-9fbe-0f35a104510d" label="lyrics-like">L Jesum veniéntem ad se, et ait:</l><l xml:id="m-846d750b-359c-47a2-b9a3-99c7b10d9a97" facs="#m-8bc90672-2b75-4a38-9c83-2731f46cc340" label="lyrics-like">lúmbam de caelo, et mansit super</l><l xml:id="m-0758ceba-65c8-4f69-a34c-28605eca6d5c" facs="#m-35fc0e77-98ed-4bd4-ab04-e18b554e722c" label="ambiguous">Ecce Agnus Dei, ecce qui tollit pec¬</l><l xml:id="m-e3b0c25c-8133-47b3-8845-8634d7b3e722" facs="#m-c95b3e9d-be59-48ca-8076-45c6b2f8e288" label="lyrics-like">eum. Et ego nesciébam eum: s</l><l xml:id="m-0f8dacb7-2c8b-4a10-98a4-cbe98d66be92" facs="#m-a67b011e-da49-4de6-8a74-810f0796ec33" label="lyrics-like">qui misit me baptizáre in aqua, ille</l><l xml:id="m-a87fb6b0-76c8-495c-835d-e376c12cdd93" facs="#m-f055af53-2bb8-4ccb-b541-3a9189ee202e" label="lyrics-like">cátum mundi. Hic est, de quo dixi:</l><l xml:id="m-3fe571a5-3d77-4fec-acff-9b63399768c0" facs="#m-ee3b79cd-fd8a-4fd9-a10a-35dea07217ca" label="ambiguous">Post me venit vir, qui ante me fa¬</l><l xml:id="m-981cdbf1-c04c-47ed-9920-c6e641e93641" facs="#m-8aab8033-337b-49fd-8f1c-577a55217169" label="lyrics-like">mihi dixit:Super quem víderis Spí¬</l><l xml:id="m-210fa93f-3efa-4e79-81fc-bfc1e3f0b752" facs="#m-65cb6ba9-a8d6-4f55-a8f3-7bf34369b7b0" label="lyrics-like">ritum descendéntem, et manéntem</l><l xml:id="m-5a164c9d-e7b5-4fcc-8f10-643ba697e355" facs="#m-19ed6350-dab2-4367-982e-d2ca320a32d1" label="ambiguous">ctus est: quia prior me erat. Et ego</l><l xml:id="m-84ccde93-c9b4-405b-9c78-191019dc2641" facs="#m-05507d55-1e83-4434-9fb3-04abd22be12c" label="lyrics-like">nesciébam eum, sed ut manifestétur</l><l xml:id="m-7f78b769-3e14-4f2d-b96a-9c34614914f6" facs="#m-a840f85f-bb4d-4f57-8dd5-8e6a383eca0c" label="lyrics-like">super eum, hic est, qui baptízat in</l><l xml:id="m-6ba2c6f3-4423-4be0-9062-5ced077a4d05" facs="#m-420bcd4f-7bc3-449e-8786-9d25cdc787f4" label="lyrics-like">in Israel, proptérea veni ego in</l><l xml:id="m-9d42a09c-80e5-4b7f-b351-487adc24827f" facs="#m-b637988d-d6dc-48ad-becd-17a5d288abec" label="ambiguous">Spiritu Sancto. Et ego vidi : et te¬</l><l xml:id="m-05601a9d-ae02-4e78-ab22-4890615c0c78" facs="#m-0c0c4c35-48ec-4e00-b3c7-f4837256bc07" label="lyrics-like">aqua baptizans. Et testimónium</l><l xml:id="m-a7e80f2a-1169-454e-a6f0-061543408f78" facs="#m-f052a077-a3fd-4256-a200-66abb8b0e762" label="lyrics-like">stimónium perhíbui, quia hic est</l><l xml:id="m-7b5f5ac5-d7c1-46a7-ad67-f3476e36dd8c" facs="#m-bd8ac481-e6a1-4f9a-b84a-170d35594cbe" label="lyrics-like">perhibuit Joánnes, dicens: Quia vidi l Filius Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-45afaec1-bc5d-47db-ab77-00cf0673349c" facs="#m-b696509d-ffef-4ed6-b7d6-4d15abe7025d" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>